{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14107070","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14107070","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1410707001:1":{"text":"It was really here... It's the Eclipsion!","source_cn":"真的在这里！杜恩加尔……是杜恩加尔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5078E2B9965FE66C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1410707002:1":{"text":"Eldric! You despicable man! No wonder you were so confident about resurrecting Helthor... You had the Eclipsion this whole time!","source_cn":"弗林！这可恶的小老头……怪不得他对复活赫托信心十足……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9316B843EA2F8620","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410707003:1":{"text":"Let's take a deep breath. It may be just a replica.","source_cn":"你冷静下来仔细看看，我怀疑只是个仿品。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54812E3F9D43045A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410707004:1":{"text":"Use your eyes! I know I'm right. Helthor himself forged that weapon with the flames of a dragon!","source_cn":"轮不到你怀疑！我相信我的眼睛！错不了，那可是赫托亲手用...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54305D097FA0EB4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410707005:1":{"text":"Even if it's far away, even if I don't understand magic... I can feel the power it exudes!","source_cn":"即便离得这么远，即便不懂魔法……我也能感受到它散发出来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9297ED11322E599B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410707006:1":{"text":"The Eclipsion cannot be replicated. No doubt it's the real deal!","source_cn":"杜恩加尔根本不可能被仿造！毋庸置疑，那是真品！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12365D1176398571","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410707007:1":{"text":"Strange... There's a dark energy around that bow.","source_cn":"怪了……那把弓上附有阴暗黏腻的气息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6DFF8633950F09E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410707008:1":{"text":"Although it's very weak, it's definitely not divine power.","source_cn":"虽然气息很微弱，但我认为那绝对不是神明的力量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB75EE0F20CF97276","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1410707008":{"text":"Although it's very weak, it's definitely not divine power.","source_cn":"虽然气息很微弱，但我认为那绝对不是神明的力量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB75EE0F20CF97276","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410707009:1":{"text":"I'm familiar with the queen's magic. The two are not the same.","source_cn":"我熟悉女王的魔力，二者并不相似，不是女王。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63DEAB897148B59D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410707012:1":{"text":"Something foul has tainted the Eclipsion...?","source_cn":"你们在讨论什么啊？听着像是有什么脏东西玷污了杜恩加尔，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB939AF4E5794B248","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410707013:1":{"text":"It does seem to have been tampered with.","source_cn":"很形象的比喻，你的理解没错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C384E82F9AA2B24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410707014:1":{"text":"But that's THE Eclipsion! Who has that type of power?! Not to mention, it's been lost for so long. I mean... this person would have to be as powerful as Helthor or the Primordial Dragon!","source_cn":"喂……那可是杜恩加尔，谁有这么大的本领！且不说它失落已...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13CC04DD1123D67D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410707015:1":{"text":"You must be mistaken! Let's go take a closer look.","source_cn":"你们一定是搞错了，走近点再看看吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F8E5041FFC83D53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"Could be the queen's magic.","source_cn":"可能是女王的气息","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD6EDC76A63DAB47E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Could be the queen's magic.","female":"Could be the queen's magic.","variant_male_record_index":"71592","variant_female_record_index":"71593","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1410707010:1":{"text":"I've never laid eyes on a Hypogean. However, I've heard tales of them but not much else.","source_cn":"恶魔吗……我对它们不太了解。我从未亲眼见过恶魔，只零星...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EC16D8D65D5546C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"Hypogean magic, perhaps?","source_cn":"可能是恶魔的气息","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEB84137EADDDAA49","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Hypogean magic, perhaps?","female":"Hypogean magic, perhaps?","variant_male_record_index":"71594","variant_female_record_index":"71595","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410707011:1":{"text":"But dwarves cannot use any magic, let alone infuse a weapon with magical power.","source_cn":"可是矮人并不会使用魔法，更谈不上将魔力留在那把武器上了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A06E9CE9D68678A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:2:3":{"text":"Could it be dwarven?","source_cn":"可能是矮人的气息","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8956B2906F4CDCB4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Could it be dwarven?","female":"Could it be dwarven?","variant_male_record_index":"71596","variant_female_record_index":"71597","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"Zanie","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"Indris","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":20,"localized_text_count":19,"speaker_count":2}}